!apps/web/build/
!apps/web/build/**
# A store directory created when pnpm is run inside the repo; runtime cache, not source.
.pnpm-store/
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.local
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
logs/
*.log
__pycache__/

# Reference material & test artifacts (never publish)
screenshots/
shots/
awwwards_ascii_motion*.html
Stirling-PDF-main/
tests/fixtures/torture/
tests/benchmarks/.corpus/
tests/e2e/artifacts/
tests/artifacts/
genoffice-main/
excise-develop/
pdf-redaction-master/
pdfcraft-main/

# Agent skill installs: local tooling for the coding session, not product code.
# .taste-skill/ holds that skill's captures (window JPGs, critiques, report.json).
.agents/
.claude/
.taste-skill/
skills-lock.json
# Test inputs are ignored so a session cannot sweep up junk, but the two fixtures
# the CI browser gates load are committed. `imaged.pdf` is the only PDF here that
# exercises pdf.js's scratch-canvas path; `alpha.pdf` is the plain text document
# a11y/keyboard/verify use. Both bugs they guard against shipped because the file
# was missing, so neither can stay a local-only artifact. Re-include needs the
# parent rule to match files rather than the directory, or git never descends
# into it.
tests/e2e/fixtures/*
!tests/e2e/fixtures/imaged.pdf
!tests/e2e/fixtures/alpha.pdf

# Server work directory (uploads + results): runtime state, never committed.
.work/
apps/api/.work/

# Raw design sources for already-published brand/hero assets. The served copies
# are committed under apps/web/public/brand/ and apps/web/public/hero/ (93a05dd),
# and the pindown video and the stem plate hash-match their published twins
# exactly. What lives here is the originals: the stock downloads (the pindown.io
# video, the Library of Congress reading-room and Archives New Zealand probate
# photographs with their credits.json) and the PNG origins of the webp plates.
# Third-party raw media stays out of git until its licence terms are recorded in
# licenses/. Root-anchored so app-source font assets (apps/web/src/assets/,
# whose licence terms ARE recorded in licenses/) still ship in git.
/assets/
/logo/

# Downloaded OAuth client credentials from Google Cloud Console. The filename
# itself encodes the client id and the body contains the client secret; neither
# belongs in git. Real values live in the gitignored `.env`.
client_secret*.json
*.apps.googleusercontent.com.json

# Regenerated by test/layoutBenchmark.test.ts on every run; the committed
# before/after pair is the record.
tests/benchmarks/layout-benchmark-latest.md

# Local Cloudflare state from `wrangler pages dev` (the emulator used to
# verify the Pages routing locally).
.wrangler/
